.TH SURFD-HWPROBE 1 "October 2026" "surfd 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
surfd-hwprobe \- suggest drivers and firmware for this machine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B surfd-hwprobe
.RB [ --json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads
.IR /sys ,
.I /proc
and the kernel log and prints suggestions with the exact commands to run:
NVIDIA and Broadcom drivers from RPM Fusion, SOF audio firmware, missing
firmware files reported at boot, codec packages for hardware video
decoding, guest tools for virtual machines, and Secure Boot module
signing. It never installs anything.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --json
Print a machine-readable report.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR surfctl (1)
